OL,3,GNEWSAFood influencers v critics: Why
OL,4,Acredibility counts
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen stuck for ideas about where to eat
OL,7,Fon a Friday night or torn between
OL,8,Ftakeaways, more and more people are
OL,9,Fturning to social media and their
OL,10,Ffavourite content creators for
OL,11,Finspiration.
OL,13,FResearch by one Bristol food writer has
OL,14,Fraised questions about transparency,
OL,15,Fwith some creators guaranteeing
OL,16,Fpositive coverage in advance and
OL,17,Foffering not to make clear their review
OL,18,Fwas in exchange for a free meal.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
