OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFood influencers v critics: Why
OL,4,Acredibility counts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose promises of good reviews were
OL,7,Fmade before they had eaten a bite - or
OL,8,Frealised the restaurant they had been
OL,9,Fasked to promote did not exist.
OL,11,FSo can diners trust influencers to give
OL,12,Fan honest opinion and what is their
OL,13,Frole in shaping where we eat? We asked
OL,14,Fpeople in the food scene to share their
OL,15,Fthoughts.
